.godot/
*.tmp
build/
__pycache__/
# Godot 4.7 generates a *.uid sidecar next to every .gd script on --import.
# These sidecars are intentionally committed (per upstream guidance: commit
# *.uid, ignore only .godot/) so fresh clones and CI share stable UIDs.
# Do NOT add *.uid to this file. When adding a new script, `git add` its
# .uid sidecar alongside the .gd file.
# CI and local Godot runs write import.log / uid-status.log; keep them untracked.
*.log
